Module185172Name=MultiFilter
Module185172Desc=Multiselect and "Not defined" search filters on lists
MultifilterSetup=MultiFilter setup
MultifilterSetupIntro=On list pages, the targeted single-choice filters become multiselects with a "Not defined" entry: search several payment terms, payment modes or extrafield values at once, and find the records with no value set. No core file is modified.
MultifilterFeaturePayment=Payment modes and payment terms (customer invoices, orders, proposals, supplier invoices)
MultifilterFeatureExtrafields=Extrafields of type list (sellist) and select, on all lists
MultifilterFeatureNotDefined=Add the "Not defined" entry (records with no value)
MultifilterFeatureDebug=Traces in the browser console and in the Dolibarr syslog
MultifilterNotDefined=Not defined
MultifilterCoveredLists=Covered lists
MultifilterCoveredFields=Transformed filters
MultifilterExtrafieldsTypes=Extrafields of type "List from a table" (sellist) and "Select" (select)
MultifilterHint=Selected values are kept through pagination, sorting, exports and the "restore last search" feature. The original filter stays in place but hidden: disabling the module gives the lists back untouched.
MultifilterExtrafieldsLists=Core lists joining extrafields (%s known contexts)
MultifilterExtraContexts=Extra hook contexts (third-party lists joining extrafields with the "ef" alias), comma separated
